description = "[PAWN_nameDef] provided medical care on multiple plague-wracked worlds, always working under the Hippocratic oath. [PAWN_pronoun] improved conditions for those under quarantine while administering complex medical treatments and developing medicines.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] never had time to enjoy a normal life outside of work."
